  "findings": [
    "M1 Lanczos3 has the strongest aggregate PSNR, SSIM, HF correlation, and lowest registered temporal error among the four frozen methods.",
    "M2 base-only bilinear beats both Forge arms on all four R1 structural classes for HF correlation; neither Forge arm reaches the plus-10-percent survival target on any R1 class.",
