    "The R1 causal residual correlations and signed projections for both Forge arms are negative in aggregate, so the measured residual is not supported as ground-truth-correlated recovery.",
    "The R1-versus-R2 contrast does not reveal a Forge advantage over M2; any regime contrast is shared with or weaker than the spatial baseline."
